  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nThe Filmic recipe draws inspiration from the timeless charm of analog photography, bringing versatility to your all-around shooting. With warm, cinematic tones, it transforms your images into evocative works of nostalgia and artistry. Adjust the white balance to maintain perfectly balanced and harmonious tones, tailored to your scene. In challenging lighting conditions, activate Active D-Lighting to preserve highlights, manage contrast, and expose your images to the right with confidence. The Filmic recipe seamlessly blends modern flexibility with a classic aesthetic, turning everyday moments into timeless memories.",
